{
  "id": "obsidian-flames-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Obsidian Flames Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Obsidian Flames prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 29–30 July and 5–6 August 2023, and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program from 28 July. Each box held four Obsidian Flames booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Obsidian Flames logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Palafin, Toxtricity and Togekiss, which booster packs have only in holofoil, and both non-holo Professor's Research cards of Scarlet & Violet, Professor Sada's and Professor Turo's.",
